What is Included?
A complete Request for Bank or Credit Reference usually includes:
• Applicant’s full name
• Bank or institution details
• Authorization to release information
• Purpose of the request
• Account relationship details
• Credit history inquiry
• Signature of applicant
• Date of request
• Contact details of requester

